2026-11-09T10:51:13.7292720Z             "body": "## OC-S1-CI-003 handoff — 2026-11-09\n\nFinal HEAD `874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c`. **DRAFT · PARTIAL/BLOCKED · Sprint1 NOT COMPLETE.** Main and the13 required check identities are unchanged.\n\n### Implemented / observed\n\n- Corrected Black formatting. Baseline coverage failure was “No data to combine” after formatting prevented test execution; current reporting succeeds with62.94% measured configured subset. No quality/coverage thresholds changed.\n- Provisioned runtime-only proxy_ca file secrets in required build actions and owned Compose override; required=true and TLS verification remain. Actual tiny BuildKit test fails without secret and passes with CERT_REQUIRED/check_hostname enabled. Full application/Compose builds remain locally BLOCKED by0–350MiB Docker backing storage. The historical Access private failure log was not uploaded; do not claim its sole cause is proven. New redacted log retention/cleanup fixes that evidence gap.\n- Coordinated revisioned parent/child source updates reuse one authoritative ledger and transaction; expected source/resource revisions, same-tenant checks, stale rollback and UI snapshot-loading safety verified.\n- Catalogue PATCH/retirement use mandatory version CAS, immutable publication/retirement history and server-derived actor. Real browser stale conflict preserves edits until explicit review/adoption/retry. Existing source pins remain.\n- Exported actual six collector-method and HTTPS template schemas; controlled negative tests pass. Genuine provider certification remains BLOCKED; no authorized target was accessed.\n\n### Local results — overlap, do not sum\n\n| Suite | Actual result |\n|---|---|\n|Broad PostgreSQL backend discovery|594 PASS,76 SKIPPED,0 FAIL among670; later obsolete retirement assertion failed and is retained|\n|Source/ETL PostgreSQL + HTTP + faults|46 PASS,0 FAIL/SKIP; migration0043 and108-table restore|\n|ETL regression|117 PASS,0 FAIL/SKIP|\n|Integrated final HTTP/browser|98 backend cases PASS;15 pipeline HTTP groups; RBAC14; resource-browser9 and workspace15; other browser17/5/3; archive/recovery checks PASS|\n|Access|25 PostgreSQL/HTTP groups +8 authenticated browser groups PASS; not a Compose packaging PASS|\n|Frontend / CI policy / quality|55 frontend PASS;30 CI PASS;28 workflows valid;48 Black files, Ruff, pinned Prettier, lint/build PASS|\n|Security|7+10+4 unit groups PASS; strict pip-audit0/npm0 on retry; seven image policies still FAIL|\n\n[Report](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/REPORT.md) · [source/test identities](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/SOURCE_IDENTITIES.json) · [exact commands and failures](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/TEST_EXECUTIONS.json) · [984 scan matches](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/CVE_REMEDIATION.csv) · [2,451 licence records](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/LICENCE_NOTICE_REVIEW.csv) · [remaining blockers](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/REMAINING_BLOCKERS.md).\n\nEvidence inventory2,513 files. Parent manifest SHA256 `1469a7efdc5e9ea3f7e919e7078a6e6563fa66ff08048694a1cc396b28033163`. Original scan provenance/checksums unchanged; failed attempts/screenshots/database receipts/cleanup retained. Synthetic private archives removed; no broad Docker cleanup.\n\n### Image/licence outcome — no waiver\n\n- Runtime/migration:59 High each. Frontend/gateway:3 Medium each and still pending accountable licence review. PostgreSQL:3 Critical/32 High. Collector:19 Critical/81 High/2 Unknown. UAT:19 Critical/140 High/2 Unknown. These belong to the examined54f26e5 hosted candidates, not new final-HEAD clearance.\n- All984 original matches retained. Collector0.123.0 and immutable pin unchanged. Vendor-wont-fix, supported gosu/collector rebuild/transition and older-binary compatibility remain unresolved. No findings excluded/reclassified or severity threshold weakened.\n- Accountable legal/distribution reviewer is NOT ASSIGNED; authoritative application licence and component NOTICE/source-offer evidence need recovery/review. Automated inventory is not a legal signature. Licence gates remain enforced.\n\n### Visual authority / separate typography task\n\n[Issue90](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/issues/90) explicitly accepts Resource Management visual baseline54f26e5; this does not approve new interactions, typography or release. New [catalogue conflict screenshot](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/raw/browser-snapshot/catalogue-cas-retry.png) and [browser assertions](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/874c481a2446022b693e6660c59af15f03c5476c/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ci003-2026-11-09/raw/browser-snapshot/workspace-ui.json) are reviewable.\nTypography proposal is separate commit `a65e26246873bfcbf26ffba7478ab12bbe2e6498`, branch `design/typography-system-v1-issue90`: [specimens/tokens/licences/audit](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/a65e26246873bfcbf26ffba7478ab12bbe2e6498/docs/design/typography-v1).384 declarations audited, Inter/Plex/Source Sans3 compared,32 desktop/theme/CSS-zoom cases pass. Native browser zoom remains BLOCKED. No product font replacement or font binaries committed. Owner font/scale approval pending.\n\n### CI TRIGGERED — RESULT PENDING\n\nSingle final-head trigger snapshot only; no polling/waiting/monitoring. Conclusions below are only those already present in that snapshot. Required integrated/build/image outcomes remain pending. Owner/reviewer monitors completion and uploads.\n\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Application Image and Worker Validation - No Deploy — 42588850820](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850820) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Disposable Reliability and Recovery — 42588850746](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850746) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL API and Browser Integration — 42588850890](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850890) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Native Monitoring Contracts — 42588850703](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850703) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Customer Ownership and Access — 42588850838](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850838) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - ETL Ownership and Monitoring Contracts — 42588850870](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850870) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL Migration and Authorization — 42588850673](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850673) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Controlled HTTPS Alert Recovery — 42588850677](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850677) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Operational Dashboard Integration — 42588850697](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850697) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Integrated Quality Regression — 42588850733](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850733) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Image SBOM Vulnerabilities and Licenses — 42588850637](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850637) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - Source Tests Lint and Build — 42588850640](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850640) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Secrets and Dependency Security — 42588850722](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850722) — success (completed at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - UAT Controller Safety Contracts - No Deploy — 42588850821](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850821) — success (completed at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - Scope and Workflow Integrity — 42588850526](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850526) — success (completed at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Sprint 1 Resource Workspace — 42588850810](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850810) — RESULT PENDING (in_progress at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Private HTTPS Monitoring — 42588850768](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850768) — success (completed at trigger snapshot).\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Network Egress Isolation — 42588850743](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42588850743) — success (completed at trigger snapshot).\n\nIndependent PR review, new-interaction owner acceptance, nine selections/D07/D08, formal UAT and genuine-provider qualification remain separate. No merge, deployment, image publication, collector upgrade or Sprint2. No branch-protection change.\n\n**CHK-001 FAIL · CHK-002 BLOCKED · SECURITY BLOCKED · RELEASE NO-GO.**\n\n<details>\n<summary>Previous descriptions and handoffs — historical evidence</summary>\n\n## Sprint 1 closure follow-up — 2026-11-08\n\nPushed final HEAD `54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6` on the existing integration branch. **Draft; PARTIAL/BLOCKED; Sprint1 NOT COMPLETE.** Main and other PR branches were not modified.\n\n### Implemented and tested\n\n- NOC harness lets Docker exclusively claim the owned interface on TLS443; unprivileged Python does not pre-bind a privileged port. No worker443/TLS/egress-policy relaxation. Local corrected target172.26.91.251:443 passed real API/PostgreSQL/React/Playwright. Historical hosted numeric address was not recorded; raw EACCES and failed high-port422 attempt retained.\n- Real occupied TCP and deterministic EACCES-injection negatives preserve exact endpoint/errno; injection is explicitly distinct from genuine kernel policy.\n- Source-context updates reuse the existing atomic expected-revision/idempotency command. Legacy PATCH adapters, primary Compute Instance source/resource atomicity, applicability revalidation and fresh authorization are covered.\n- Additive migration0043 fences raw name/description/auth-mode writers. Applied migrations unchanged. Populated rollback refused before DDL; whole normalized dump hash identical before/after: `260fad554f844e35f848c5405cbb9db4f2488f45ee103007112ce532cc2ff5af`.\n- History pagination/detail/diff, explicit detach, new-revision restore, non-operational staged preview/discard and conflict refresh preserving input pass authenticated browser tests.\n- Actual API SIGKILL before ledger persistence leaves head/history/projection0; restart/retry creates exactly one revision/projection; post-commit kill/restart/idempotent replay retains one. Not an exactly-once telemetry or disk/power-loss certification.\n\n### Results — overlapping suites, not additive\n\n| Suite | Actual result |\n|---|---|\n|Final source/ETL PostgreSQL/auth HTTP|44 PASS,0 FAIL/SKIP; migration0043, API crash/restart cases,108-table restore|\n|Broad backend discovery|594 PASS,73 SKIPPED,0 FAIL among667; later obsolete HTTP expectation failed and is preserved|\n|ETL regression|117 PASS,0 FAIL/SKIP|\n|Final PostgreSQL/HTTP/browser rerun on0043|98 backend cases PASS;15 pipeline HTTP groups; Pentaho4/5/4/5; RBAC14; resource browser8, workspace14, other browser17/5/3; archive/recovery checks PASS|\n|Frontend|55 PASS; lint/build PASS; npm audit0|\n|CI/static/configuration|28 CI tests PASS;28 workflows valid;795 scope records,782 UNKNOWN still RUN; Compose/static checks PASS|\n|NOC/theme|PASS;13 theme checks,6 contrast measures; task resources cleaned|\n|Original seven image-policy roles|7 FAIL; all1,890 matches retained, no suppression/waiver|\n\n[Report](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/REPORT.md) · [exact commands/results/source commits](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/TEST_EXECUTIONS.json) · [source hashes](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/SOURCE_IDENTITIES.json) · [changed files](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/CHANGED_FILES.txt) · [image remediation](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/IMAGE_REMEDIATION.md) · [remaining blockers](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/54f26e51106469e285dd747dd6b8afd09ca43ce6/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/closure-followup-2026-11-08/REMAINING_BLOCKERS.md).\n\nParent artifact inventory covers1,933 files. Manifest SHA256: `f248fae0a7a938d0ac8f1a434e1dff03351b619c51308e5b135f17ed11bfc27b`. All seven original archive digests and raw scan manifests verified. Failed attempts, redacted screenshots, receipts, backup hashes and scoped cleanup retained; synthetic private archives and scanner caches removed.\n\n### CI TRIGGERED — RESULT PENDING\n\nAll18 workflows below identify the final HEAD. Single trigger snapshot only; no polling/waiting/monitoring. Owner/reviewer must inspect actual final results and uploaded evidence. No older successful run is substituted for final-head checks.\n\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Sprint 1 Resource Workspace — 42532627386](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42532627386) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Image SBOM Vulnerabilities and Licenses — 42532627047](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42532627047) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - Scope and Workflow Integrity — 42532627055](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42532627055) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL API and Browser Integration — 42532627151](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42532627151) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Integrated Quality Regression — 42532627097](https://github.com/P