OC Dev - Tier B - Native Monitoring Contracts — 42513541869](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541869) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Sprint 1 Resource Workspace — 42513541827](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541827) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Secrets and Dependency Security — 42513541772](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541772) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - UAT Controller Safety Contracts - No Deploy — 42513541795](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541795) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL Migration and Authorization — 42513541856](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541856) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Customer Ownership and Access — 42513541838](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541838) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL API and Browser Integration — 42513541859](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541859) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - ETL Ownership and Monitoring Contracts — 42513541771](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541771) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Private HTTPS Monitoring — 42513541866](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541866) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n\n### Remaining blockers / decisions\n\n- Ruleset 26082467 additive update refused HTTP 403 “Resource not accessible by integration”; reread confirms original 13 checks, strictness, approvals and bypass actors unchanged. Minimum prerequisite: authorised GitHub App/token with repository Administration write, followed by drift and exact check-identity validation. No bypass or required-check removal.\n- All seven historical image roles retain security policy failures and pending accountable per-component licence/NOTICE/source-offer review. No suppression, threshold reduction, digest replacement or waiver. Fresh final images/scans await hosted evidence; local Docker build backing storage is insufficient.\n- [Open configuration gaps](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/OPEN_BLOCKERS.md): atomic resource-context/legacy writer cutover, full history/diff/detach/staged-draft UI, catalogue publication concurrency, exact command crash/revocation/application-provenance cases and provider-specific qualification.\n- **Owner visual acceptance requested** for [admin/operator desktop captures and deviations](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/VISUAL_ACCEPTANCE.md); prior rejected candidate is not treated as approved. **Independent engineering PR approval requested** before any merge decision.\n- Nine owner-acceptance selections, D07/D08, independent UAT and genuine-provider certification remain pending. No Sprint 2, merge, deployment, release approval, collector upgrade or changes to unrelated durability work.\n\n**CHK-001 FAIL · CHK-002 BLOCKED · SECURITY BLOCKED · RELEASE NO-GO.**\n\n<details>\n<summary>Previous PR description (historical context)</summary>\n\nOwner-approved consolidation against post-#85 main. Initial commit is an integration ledger only; **NO source branches merged yet**. Preserve ETL, resource lifecycle, tenant/RBAC, PostgreSQL, scope and security gates. Pending semantic conflict resolution, template contracts, full authenticated/PostgreSQL CI, owner visual acceptance, and independent review. Do not merge this draft until all gates pass. See docs/verification/sprint1-integration/INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md.\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n",
